#. module: purchase_receipt_expectation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_receipt_expectation.field_purchase_order__receipt_expectation
msgid ""
"Defines how reception pickings are managed when the order is approved.\n"
"Default value is 'automatic', which means the picking will be created following the standard Odoo workflow."
msgstr ""
"Določa, kako se upravlja s pripravo blaga ob prejemu, ko je naročilo "
"odobreno.\n"
"Privzeta vrednost je 'avtomatsko', kar pomeni, da se dobavnica ustvari v "
"skladu s standardnim delovnim tokom Odoo."

